<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Golf Trust of America.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Golf Trust of America.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Roberston, Stephens &amp; Co said it initiated coverage of Golf Trust of America Inc with a buy rating.</p>
<p>-- said Golf Trust is well-positioned to grow funds from operations per share 12-15 percent annually over the next five years.</p>
<p>-- Golf Trust gained 1/8 to 24-3/4 in morning trading.</p>
<p>	  (( -- Wall Street desk 212-859-1730))</p>
